  {
    "RowId": 39700,
    "Text": "Defend Solution Nine!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39701,
    "Text": "Eliminate the mechanical soldiers"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39702,
    "Text": "Search for stragglers"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39703,
    "Text": "Eliminate the fiends"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39704,
    "Text": "Head to the aetheryte plaza"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39705,
    "Text": "Comfort the citizens"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39706,
    "Text": "Eliminate the mechanical soldiers"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39707,
    "Text": "Repel the mechanical soldiers"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39708,
    "Text": "Subdue Otis!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39709,
    "Text": "Defeat the fiend"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39710,
    "Text": "Stop the fiend from absorbing lightning"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39711,
    "Text": "Defeat the fiend before Otis succumbs!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39712,
    "Text": "Please, everyone, lend me your strength."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39713,
    "Text": "I have authority enough to move structures. A moment!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39714,
    "Text": "There... Now, please help as many as you can!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39715,
    "Text": "Right, let's deal with these ones first!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39716,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39717,
    "Text": "There are still those we can save! We keep moving!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39718,
    "Text": "I will make us a path. O Everkeep, hearken to me!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39719,
    "Text": "So many still crying out in fear and in pain... Please hold on!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39720,
    "Text": "Fiends too!? Damn you, Zoraal Ja!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39721,
    "Text": "It's up to us to stop them!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39722,
    "Text": "You're safe now. Be at ease."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39723,
    "Text": "I'm sorry for putting you through such an ordeal... It will soon be over, so please stay strong."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39724,
    "Text": "Deleted."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39725,
    "Text": "For the honor of the royal knights! Forward!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39726,
    "Text": "Snap out of it, Otis! Don't you recognize us!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39727,
    "Text": "First formation! Show them a knight's valor!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39728,
    "Text": "The machines obey him!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39729,
    "Text": "Second formation! Seize the glory of victory!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39730,
    "Text": "Something about him is familiar... But...it couldn't be..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39731,
    "Text": "Third formation! Onward, for Alexandria!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39732,
    "Text": "Don't like the looks of this... Everyone, keep your guard up!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39733,
    "Text": "It <i>is</i> him─the captain of the knights!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39734,
    "Text": "Damn it... How do we bring him to his senses!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39735,
    "Text": "If he still remembers me, then perhaps..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39736,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39737,
    "Text": "...protect...Her Majesty..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39738,
    "Text": "Apologies for the trouble I've caused.<Key>8205251</Key>So long as this body holds, I shall fight with you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39739,
    "Text": "It's building up energy! Have care!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39740,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39741,
    "Text": "It gathers lightning to itself!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39742,
    "Text": "Let's split up and deal with them!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39743,
    "Text": "Hmph! Not holding anything back, are we?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39744,
    "Text": "So many... This is going to be tough."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39745,
    "Text": "Leave this to me!<Key>8205255</Key>Behold the bladework of a royal knight!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39746,
    "Text": "'Tis but a flesh wound!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39747,
    "Text": "Such tremendous lightning!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39748,
    "Text": "Not good... At this rate..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39749,
    "Text": "Upon mine honor, we shall weather this storm!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39750,
    "Text": "Now! Lay the fiend low!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39751,
    "Text": "Otis, you must stop! Your body can't survive this!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39752,
    "Text": "Nay, I cannot yield...even should it cost me my life!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39753,
    "Text": "Otiiis!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39754,
    "Text": "My queen... Are you unharmed?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39755,
    "Text": "Behold the bladework of a royal knight!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39756,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39757,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
