  {
    "RowId": 39800,
    "Text": "Greetings and good-bye."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39801,
    "Text": "Are you alive?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39802,
    "Text": "Are you happy?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39803,
    "Text": "Let us rise above death!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39804,
    "Text": "We require aether."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39805,
    "Text": "Do not be afraid. Death is not the end. "
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39806,
    "Text": "I will show you the worlds beyond."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39807,
    "Text": "Deploying drones."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39808,
    "Text": "Are you still alive? Activating reserve power."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39809,
    "Text": "Are you still alive? Disengaging safeties."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39810,
    "Text": "Target area delineated. Commencing erasure."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39811,
    "Text": "System overload. Aborting process."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39812,
    "Text": "Are you still alive? Recommencing erasure."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39813,
    "Text": "System overload. An error has occurred."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39814,
    "Text": "System override order confirmed."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39815,
    "Text": "There...a rift in her reality! She's losing control of the power!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39816,
    "Text": "Sphene! Listen to me!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39817,
    "Text": "I understand, I do. And I know that you won't be swayed from your course."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39818,
    "Text": "But if there's truly no other way to resolve this..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39819,
    "Text": "Then face me! Not as a machine, but as the real you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39820,
    "Text": "Lamaty'i..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39821,
    "Text": "Sphene!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39822,
    "Text": "Anomaly detected in memory banks."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39823,
    "Text": "Data for the Endless “Sphene” partially restored."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39824,
    "Text": "This is what I desire...and I will not fail!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39825,
    "Text": "I can't bear to lose them! Not again!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39826,
    "Text": "I feel your pain! As if it were my own!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39827,
    "Text": "At last I think I know you─<i>all</i> of you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39828,
    "Text": "How can you say that to me now!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39829,
    "Text": "It's over, Sphene. We will stop you."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39830,
    "Text": "No! I won't let you! I can't!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39831,
    "Text": "I will protect my people's happiness!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39832,
    "Text": "Leave your burden with us now."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39833,
    "Text": "We will bear it in your stead!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39834,
    "Text": "5 seconds to Absolute Authority..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39835,
    "Text": "4 seconds to Absolute Authority..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39836,
    "Text": "3 seconds to Absolute Authority..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39837,
    "Text": "2 seconds to Absolute Authority..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 39838,
    "Text": "1 second to Absolute Authority..."
